  "totalBlocks": 29,
  "translatedBlocks": 29,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb6e476b5bf5fc22",
      "translationZh": "我们很高兴地宣布，Hugging Face 上广受欢迎的开放模型现已通过全新的 Bedrock Marketplace 在 Amazon Bedrock 上提供！AWS 客户现在可以通过 Bedrock Marketplace 部署 83 个开放模型，构建生成式 AI 应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "703527edd17e774e",
      "translationZh": "在底层，Bedrock Marketplace 的模型端点由 Amazon Sagemaker Jumpstart 管理。借助 Bedrock Marketplace，你现在可以将 SageMaker JumpStart 的易用性与 Amazon Bedrock 的完全托管基础设施相结合，并兼容 Agents、Knowledge Bases、Guardrails 和 Model Evaluations 等高级 API。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eaae2f6ba8c3bb2f",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Bedrock 中注册 Sagemaker Jumpstart 端点时，你只需支付 Sagemaker 计算资源的费用，同时适用常规的 Amazon Bedrock API 价格。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55002dc2dda45fef",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博客中，我们将向你展示如何部署 Gemma 2 27B Instruct，并通过 Amazon Bedrock API 使用该模型。你将学习如何：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "45b63d2839085e1b",
      "translationZh": "部署 Google Gemma 2 27B Instruct",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fdf143af83df8fb4",
      "translationZh": "使用 Amazon Bedrock API 发送请求",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "650917c85ce84071",
      "translationZh": "清理资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "45b63d2839085e1b",
      "translationZh": "部署 Google Gemma 2 27B Instruct",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f2f07b2e23fc0ef",
      "translationZh": "有两种方式可以部署开放模型，以便在 Amazon Bedrock 中使用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2a7bbc9eedc847ea",
      "translationZh": "你可以从 Bedrock Model Catalog 部署你的开放模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "acaae07d3e906e6f",
      "translationZh": "你可以通过 Amazon Jumpstart 部署你的开放模型，并将其注册到 Bedrock。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e071656c113be35d",
      "translationZh": "这两种方式类似，因此我们将引导你通过 Bedrock Model catalog 进行操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ff6c50e4e9a90f5",
      "translationZh": "首先，在 Amazon Bedrock 控制台中，确保你当前位于支持 Bedrock Marketplace 的 14 个区域之一。然后，在导航窗格的“Foundation models”部分选择“Model catalog”。在这里，你可以搜索无服务器模型以及 Amazon Bedrock Marketplace 中提供的模型。将提供商筛选为“Hugging Face”，即可浏览可用的 83 个开放模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5de5b8860695d62",
      "translationZh": "例如，让我们搜索并选择 Google Gemma 2 27B Instruct。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a679ee485f5c333",
      "translationZh": "选择该模型后，会打开模型详情页面，你可以在这里查看模型提供商提供的更多信息，例如模型亮点，以及包含 API 调用示例的使用说明。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aacc6cc7a3e0130a",
      "translationZh": "让我们点击右上角的“Deploy”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93860d94fd9ebc74",
      "translationZh": "这会将你带到部署页面，你可以在其中选择端点名称、实例配置，以及与网络配置和用于在 Sagemaker 中执行部署的服务角色相关的高级设置。我们使用默认的高级设置和推荐的实例类型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f274c362fedc49cf",
      "translationZh": "你还需要接受模型提供商的最终用户许可协议。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6e17c2100981042",
      "translationZh": "我们点击右下角的 Deploy（部署）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d33e5183af713ae0",
      "translationZh": "我们刚刚启动了 GoogleGemma 2 27B Instruct 模型在 ml.g5.48xlarge 实例上的部署，该实例托管在你的 Amazon Sagemaker 租户环境中，并且兼容 Amazon Bedrock APIs！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16ba577bb326e196",
      "translationZh": "端点部署可能需要几分钟。它会显示在“Marketplace deployments”（市场部署）页面上，你可以在导航窗格的“Foundation models”（基础模型）部分找到该页面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "711132ecb1ebc72b",
      "translationZh": "通过 Amazon Bedrock APIs 使用模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9b908df5768dc97",
      "translationZh": "你可以通过用户界面在 Playground 中快速测试模型。不过，要通过任意 Amazon Bedrock APIs 以编程方式调用已部署的模型，你需要获取端点 ARN。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf35ef1647624ca4",
      "translationZh": "从托管部署列表中选择你的模型部署，以复制其端点 ARN。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "652baf72da39660b",
      "translationZh": "你可以使用支持你偏好编程语言的 AWS SDK，或使用 AWS CLI 来查询你的端点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a02c1ad9951ee733",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个通过 AWS SDK for Python (boto3) 使用 Bedrock Converse API 的示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1fecf5b2fa1f43e8",
      "translationZh": "就是这样！如果你想进一步探索，可以查看 Bedrock 文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f938c3286fd72925",
      "translationZh": "清理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9568b55736286836",
      "translationZh": "别忘了在实验结束时删除你的端点，以免继续产生费用！在获取端点 ARN 的页面右上角，你可以点击“Delete”来删除端点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
